{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"　　みなさんこんにちは٩( ᐛ )و　日向坂46の丹生明里(にぶ あかり)です🐸🥕 "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ4E9QMEBE2FD94M471VFNBT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">先日レコメン！さんに出演させていただいた際にオテンキのりさんからストックホルムのお土産をいただきました😭😭😭ありがとうございます✨大切に飾らせていただきました☺️　　　そして〜！\n8月19日20:30~はるよと一緒にSHOWROOM配信をします🦦　2人でSHOWROOM配信するの初めてだから楽しみ〜🥰　皆さん絶対観てくださいね！！☺️　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ4E9RNY98FS6SNCRM64FPH5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">らいぶのとき　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ4E9SQ8QCPSZMPGN0Z4ZQ35","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">いつかのリハ　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ4E9TTJH2WXT56KSM4V9C9M","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">いつの日かの🌵　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ4E9VTJC41PCS4HWANJDFJR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">この顔かわいい😂　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ4E9WX2BGWBYRN9MVCJQ23V","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">ひなあいロケ〜　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ4E9XZEE1AXDC0HHA6PD9TP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">ちゃっかり自分　なんだかんだではるよとはいっぱい写真撮ってる気がする🤔📸いつもありがとー　読んでいただきありがとうございました　#580"}],"source":"archive"}